{"strongs": "H7158", "word": "קִרְיַתסֵֿ֫פֶר", "translit": "qir.yat san.nah", "root": "קריתספר", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "scribe-town", "definition": "קִרְיַתסֵֿ֫פֶר proper name, of a location πόλις ( τῶν ) γραμμάτων , + ( ᵐ5 B Judg 1:11 ) Καριασσωφαρ : ancient name of דְּבִיר (see II. ׳ ד 2 c ) (perhaps סֹֿפֵר ׳ ק scribe-town , compare ᵐ5 above also ᵑ6 and Egyptian Bai-ti¾u-pa-ïra , house of scribe , WMM As.u.Eur.174 Buhl Geogr.274 , compare GFM Ju ); — Josh 15:15 ; Josh 15:16 ; Judg 1:11 ; Judg 1:12 another name is סַֿנָּה ׳ ק Josh 15:49 (but ᵐ5 πόλις γραμμάτων , hence read perhaps סֿפר ׳ ק , so Steuern ), in southern Judah; on site (probably Dhoherîye , 5 hours southwest from Hebron) see II. דְּבִיר 2 c and Buhl Geogr.164 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7582')\">BDB7582</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7158')\">H7158</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7581')\">BDB7581</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7583')\">BDB7583</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קִרְיַתסֵֿ֫פֶר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a location</b> <grk>πόλις</grk>(<grk>τῶν</grk>)<grk>γραμμάτων</grk>, + (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('B')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>B</sup></reflink></lookup> <ref ref=\"Judg 1:11\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(7,1,11)\">Judg 1:11</ref>) <grk>Καριασσωφαρ</grk>: ancient name of <bdbheb>דְּבִיר</bdbheb> (see II. <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ד</bdbheb> <b>2 c</b>) (perhaps <bdbheb>סֹֿפֵר</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <highlight>scribe-town</highlight>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> above also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> and Egyptian <transliteration><highlight>Bai-ti¾u-pa-ïra</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>house of scribe</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('WMM')\">WMM<